m920205.時間そのものを操る膨大な魔力、\nそれがディアスの手に渡れば、\nもう誰も、やつ:
The immense power to manipulate time itself,
if it falls into Dias's hands,
no one will be able to stop him.

m920232.そのおとぎ話が事実かどうかはともかく、\nギルガメッシュを追うなら、\n調査に赴:
Whether that fairy tale is true or not,
if we're to pursue Gilgamesh,
we have no choice but to launch an investigation.

m920232.（千年の長きにわたり、\n王国の――いや、英雄王のために、\n魔界で戦い続けた男:
(A man who has continued to fight in the Demon Realm
for a thousand years—for the Kingdom,
no, for the Hero King…)

m940010.ベラドンナよ、お前は生き延びるのだ！\n家宝の剣を持ち出せば、\n王国なりどこな:
Belladonna, you must survive!
Take our family heirloom sword with you;
the Kingdom or anywhere else will surely shelter you!
